# EPIC-008 — The Final Illusion

Full spec: `docs/EPIC-008.md`

Create the illusion ORACLY was **discovered**, not programmed. No redesign. No features. No complexity increase.

## Core question

*What still reminds the user this is software?* → Reduce it.

## Remove digital feeling

Mechanical · Repetitive · Purposeless symmetry · Abrupt motion · Generic Material · Spinner loading

## Replace with

Weighted pauses · Stagger jitter · Desync breath · Chamber waiting orb · Tab/ritual continuity · Micro imperfection (almost invisible)

## Never

Reset atmosphere between screens · Use raw spinners/SnackBars where themed systems exist · Perfect metronome staggers

## Success

User feels *"this place has a soul"* — not *"beautiful app"* or *"nice animations."*

If they notice the craft, it was too much.
